## 3. Operational Achievability

### What Makes This Achievable

| Requirement | Solution |
|-------------|----------|
| Customer onboarding | Terraform module triggered by config file merge → Creates projects, namespaces, IAM |
| Product deployment | GitOps ApplicationSet → Add customer config, ArgoCD deploys automatically |
| Version divergence | Customer config specifies `productVersion: v2.3.1` → Helm chart version pinned per customer |
| Customer customizations | Layered Helm values: `base → product → environment → customer` |
| Scaling to 500+ | No code changes; just add customer config files |

