## Isolation Layers (Defense in Depth)

| Layer | Mechanism | What It Prevents |
|-------|-----------|------------------|
| **1. GCP Project** | Each customer has dedicated data project | Resource-level isolation, billing separation |
| **2. IAM** | Customer SA can only access their project | Cross-customer API access |
| **3. Workload Identity** | K8s SA → GCP SA mapping per customer | Pod impersonation attacks |
| **4. VPC Service Controls** | Perimeter around customer data project | Data exfiltration, cross-project access |
| **5. Network Policy** | Namespace isolation in K8s | Pod-to-pod cross-tenant traffic |
| **6. Resource Quotas** | Per-namespace limits | Noisy neighbor resource exhaustion |
| **7. Private Google Access** | Data accessed via private IPs | Public internet exposure |

