## Cost Categories

| Category | Where It Lives | How to Attribute |
|----------|---------------|------------------|
| **Customer Data** (Cloud SQL, GCS, BigQuery) | Customer's own project | Direct billing - 100% to customer |
| **Dedicated Compute** (dedicated GKE cluster) | Customer-specific or shared project | Direct billing or labeled |
| **Shared Compute** (shared GKE clusters) | Platform project | Allocate based on usage metrics |
| **Platform Services** (ArgoCD, monitoring) | Platform project | Allocate as platform fee or % overhead |
| **Networking** (VPC, NAT, Interconnect) | Shared project | Allocate based on egress or flat fee |

