## Strategy 2: GKE Usage Metering

GKE has built-in **usage metering** that tracks resource consumption per namespace.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    GKE USAGE METERING                                       │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                             │
│   Enable on GKE Cluster:                                                   │
│   ──────────────────────                                                   │
│   resource_usage_export_config {                                           │
│     enable_network_egress_metering = true                                  │
│     enable_resource_consumption_metering = true                            │
│     bigquery_destination {                                                 │
│       dataset_id = "gke_usage_metering"                                   │
│     }                                                                      │
│   }                                                                        │
│                                                                             │
│   Data Exported to BigQuery:                                               │
│   ──────────────────────────                                               │
│   • CPU usage per namespace (request & actual)                            │
│   • Memory usage per namespace (request & actual)                         │
│   • Network egress per namespace                                          │
│   • GPU usage (if applicable)                                             │
│   • Storage (PVC) usage                                                   │
│                                                                             │
│   Sample Query:                                                            │
│   ──────────────                                                           │
│   SELECT                                                                   │
│     namespace,                                                             │
│     SPLIT(namespace, '-')[OFFSET(0)] as customer,                         │
│     SUM(cpu_request_seconds) as total_cpu_seconds,                        │
│     SUM(memory_request_byte_seconds) as total_memory_bytes                │
│   FROM `project.gke_usage_metering.gke_cluster_resource_usage`            │
│   WHERE _PARTITIONTIME >= TIMESTAMP_SUB(CURRENT_TIMESTAMP(), INTERVAL 30 DAY)│
│   GROUP BY namespace                                                       │
│                                                                             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Terraform for GKE Usage Metering

```hcl
resource "google_container_cluster" "shared_cluster" {
  name     = "nonprod-us-east1-md-01"
  location = "us-east1"
  
  resource_usage_export_config {
    enable_network_egress_metering       = true
    enable_resource_consumption_metering = true
    
    bigquery_destination {
      dataset_id = google_bigquery_dataset.gke_metering.dataset_id
    }
  }
}

resource "google_bigquery_dataset" "gke_metering" {
  dataset_id = "gke_usage_metering"
  project    = "platform-billing"
  location   = "US"
}
```

