## Strategy 3: Resource Quotas as Cost Controls

Enforce resource limits per namespace to control costs and ensure fair sharing.

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: ResourceQuota
metadata:
  name: customer-quota
  namespace: acme-corp-dev
spec:
  hard:
    requests.cpu: "10"           # 10 CPU cores max
    requests.memory: "20Gi"      # 20 GB memory max
    limits.cpu: "20"
    limits.memory: "40Gi"
    persistentvolumeclaims: "10"
    services.loadbalancers: "2"
    count/pods: "100"
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: LimitRange
metadata:
  name: default-limits
  namespace: acme-corp-dev
