## Summary: How Data Sharing Works

| Storage | Mechanism | Cross-Env Sharing (Same Customer) | Cross-Customer Isolation |
|---------|-----------|-----------------------------------|--------------------------|
| **Cloud SQL** | PostgreSQL schemas + GRANT | Shared schema + SELECT grants across env schemas | No grants between customers |
| **BigQuery** | Row-level security | Filter on `tenant_id` only for non-prod | Filter includes `tenant_id` match |
| **GCS** | IAM conditions on prefix | Multiple prefix grants to same SA | Different prefixes, no cross-grants |

| Environment | Can Write To | Can Read From |
|-------------|--------------|---------------|
| **Dev** | dev schema/prefix | dev, stage, uat, prod, shared |
| **Stage** | stage schema/prefix | dev, stage, uat, prod, shared |
| **UAT** | uat schema/prefix | dev, stage, uat, prod, shared |
| **Prod** | prod schema/prefix | prod, shared **ONLY** |

