## Summary: GCP Native vs Custom Scripts

| Approach | Cloud SQL | BigQuery | GCS |
|----------|-----------|----------|-----|
| **Real-time Read Access** | Read Replica | Authorized Views | Same bucket + IAM |
| **Scheduled Copy** | Clone Instance + Cloud Scheduler | Scheduled Queries | Storage Transfer Service |
| **On-Demand Copy** | gcloud sql instances clone | bq cp / Scheduled Query manual run | gsutil rsync |
| **Anonymization** | Post-clone SQL script | In-view transforms / Scheduled Query | N/A (exclude sensitive prefixes) |
| **Cost** | Replica instance cost | View = free, Scheduled Query = query cost | Transfer = free, storage cost |
| **Complexity** | Low | Low | Very Low |
| **Custom Code** | Minimal (anonymization only) | None (SQL in views/queries) | None |

