    ```
    
    Customer Product Selection:
    - Customer config includes products.yaml specifying:
      - Which products are enabled
      - Version per product (can differ from latest)
      - Per-environment configuration overrides
      - Infrastructure sizing overrides
      - Product-specific configuration
    
